\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 If Toggle is OFF: Retain existing full-screen button for standard photo mode.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 If Toggle is ON: Split the screen into two distinct clickable regions:\
